{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1ubJmNjddbXbiKDnQj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: reshape. Don't build the three screens as proposed.**\n\n**Why**\n- Of the 9% who cancel each month, about 4.9 points are trip-only users. They don't have a problem with the product. They're done with the need. A feature reminder or \"are you sure?\" survey won't change that, and a discount mostly gives away margin on people who were leaving anyway.\n- Only the remaining ~4.1 points are plausibly saveable, and even then only some of them, depending on why they leave.\n- Three stacked screens add friction. They invite complaints, refunds and chargebacks. They may also run into click-to-cancel rules (FTC, EU) and app-store guidelines, so check those before shipping.\n\n**What to build in two weeks**\nOne cancel screen that asks the reason first, then branches:\n- **Trip or temporary need:** offer a pause (1–3 months) or a cheap short-term plan, plus easy reactivation. This targets the largest group.\n- **Price:** offer a discount.\n- **Other reasons:** show no offer, just a clean cancel.\n\nThis is one designer-and-engineer-sized job. Ship it as an A/B test against the current flow.\n\n**Measure**\n- Primary metric: retained revenue at 90 days, not saves at the screen.\n- Guardrails: cancel-flow abandonment, support tickets, refunds and chargebacks.\n\n**Caveats**\n- The 54% is self-reported and only covers people who answered the survey.\n- I don't know how many trip users come back later. If many do, pause plus reactivation is worth even more.\n- I don't know how much the discount costs you or how price-sensitive the other 46% are.\n\nIf the growth lead wants the full three-screen version, it can be tested later as a challenger once the branching flow sets a baseline."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3456,"cache_read_input_tokens":5014,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3456},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ac8170d-46b4-42b7-8a6a-68a9a9f23ca8","uuid":"556506c1-8b94-4d49-9b26-c7c4f5dbefbd","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:18:22.607Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1ub5Nw2Wk7nrF4kJx9"}
